{"detail": {"templateUuid": "163ddafdd6a442afa0bcfdae93b39987", "projectUuid": "aa2b87544f53411c89b5681d3823b5cd", "name": "晋王李定国", "description": "十岁被张献忠收养，本是“流寇”之子，却成了挽救华夏的最后战神！面对清军铁骑，李定国秉承联明抗清的遗命，用兵如神，两厥名王。但他面对的，是一场注定孤独的死局：结拜大哥背刺降清、友军坐视不救、决死伏击又遭叛徒告密。在无尽的背叛与绝望中，他率领残兵血战到底，最终于荒外泣血北望，留下“宁死荒外，勿降也”的绝命遗言。  本片将带您走近这位“出身流寇，却活得腰杆最直”的悲剧英雄。他输了天下，却用不屈的风骨，点燃了三百年后跨越时空的民族魂！", "coverUrl": "/assets/1aba25da36c03f35.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/81ab1376a763465f9834c715dbf068a7/01b4c68fa6783b73ae8c6dadad814cc663eb9d49.mp4", "snapshotId": 19618, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8543130, "ownerUuid": "81ab1376a763465f9834c715dbf068a7", "avatar": "/assets/3baeab288a89a710.webp", "nickname": "者行孙AIGC", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 11, "tags": [{"id": 1501, "code": "humanity_science", "tagLabel": "人文科普", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1501/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/F6JKtLF2a1E/", "createAt": "2026年06月15日 21:25", "updateAt": "2026年07月01日 18:09", "publishAt": "2026年07月01日 17:57", "playCount": 17, "viewCreationProcessCount": 8, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/163ddafdd6a442afa0bcfdae93b39987.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 172, "edges": 165}}, "recommendList": []}